    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <details><summary>What does the $5 fee cover?</summary><p>Writing and posting the listing, answering buyer messages, and negotiating, etc. Basically all the boring stuff. There are no commissions or other fees.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I get paid?</summary><p>The buyer pays you directly when you meet — just like you would normally. Cash, Venmo, or whatever you would prefer. You tell us and we'll tell the buyer. 100% of the sale price is yours.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if my item doesn't sell?</summary><p>You've still paid only the $5, and nothing else. If it hasn't sold after a week, we may lower the price by up to 10% — it never goes below your floor without your approval, and you can message us any time to check on your listing.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I need the Facebook app?</summary><p>You need a Facebook account to chat with us in Messenger, but not necessarily the app — Messenger also works in a web browser.</p></details>
